  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:98106",
   "off": 622854,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「おめぐみを …」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Spare a coin...?\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:9811b",
   "off": 622875,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "２０Ｇをあたえますか？\u0019",
   "en": "Give him 20G?\u0019",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:9813c",
   "off": 622908,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「それは 残念なことじゃ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Ah, that's a shame, that is.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:98162",
   "off": 622946,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「貧乏人め！」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Penniless wretch!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:98180",
   "off": 622976,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:981a4",
   "off": 623012,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  二つの世界を結ぶ\r  門の話を聞いたことが\r  ありやすか？」\u0010",
   "en": "Ever heard tell of a gate that joins two worlds?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:981f9",
   "off": 623097,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:9821d",
   "off": 623133,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  地の底には\r  他の世界の化け物が\r  すんでるって…」\u0010",
   "en": "They say monsters from other worlds live down at the bottom of the earth...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:9826c",
   "off": 623212,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:98290",
   "off": 623248,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  国のどこかに\r  五つの紋章の迷宮が\r  あるんですよ」\u0010",
   "en": "Somewhere in this land there are five Crest Labyrinths, y'know.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:982df",
   "off": 623327,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… 毎度ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, as always.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:98307",
   "off": 623367,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ですが だんな\u0017 もう\r  あっしが知っている\r  情報は ありませんぜ」\u0010",
   "en": "But, guv,\u0017 that's all the news I've got.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
