  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES08:984c4",
   "off": 623812,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「国王は我々の暮らしを\r  守ってくださる\u0010\b  王国の娘は 命と魂を\r  守ってくださる」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The King protects our livelihoods.\u0010\bThe Daughter of the Kingdom protects our lives and souls.\"\u0010",
